 "title": "30 V N-channel trench MOSFET in DFN 3x3 EP",
 "source": {
  "revision": "Rev.1.1, October 2023",
  "pages": 6
 },
 "summary": "A single 30 V N-channel enhancement MOSFET built with trench power technology, in a 3 mm by 3 mm DFN with an exposed pad: three source leads, one gate lead and four drain leads. On-resistance is under 5 mΩ at 10 V gate drive and under 8.5 mΩ at 4.5 V; it carries 30 A continuously with the case at 25 °C (package limited) and 120 A pulsed. Every unit is tested for avalanche and gate resistance. Intended for DC/DC conversion in computers, servers, point-of-load rails, and telecom and industrial supplies.",
